DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuttwwiittcchh driver provides support for the Maywa-denki & KAYAC YUREX de‐
     vice.  The device has a sensor to count user's leg twitch and it pos‐
     sesses a collection of sensor values which are made available through the
     sysctl(8) interface.  The counter unit for twitch is "BBU" (BinBo-YUsuri
     or Bounding Body from Unconsciousness) and the unit for BBU speed is
     "mBBU/sec" (milli BBU per second).

